            "role": "A",
            "text": "上一段讲到「新认知机」。现在把镜头转向「卷积神经网络与 LeNet」，沿着这条故事线换一个问题：把时间拨回1989年，「卷积神经网络与 LeNet」究竟在解决一个什么样的难题？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "storyline-sequence"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "杨立昆及合作者证明，用反向传播训练的卷积网络可以识别手写邮编。LeNet 成为端到端卷积感知系统的标志性案例。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-backpropagation-applied-to-handwritten-zip-code-recognition"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "卷积提取局部笔画，池化稳定特征，分类器预测数字。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-backpropagation-applied-to-handwritten-zip-code-recognition"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把 LeNet 视为早期经典证据，证明卷积、权重共享和反向传播可以解决真实感知任务。它的长期影响在于端到端 CNN 模式后来扩展成现代计算机视觉的基础。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-backpropagation-applied-to-handwritten-zip-code-recognition"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
